== Overview ==
The '''Giant Glasses Toilet''' is a supersized version of the [[Glass Toilet|Glasses Toilet]] which, has glasses to protect against TVs AoE blast. It appears in Hard Mode and Nightmare Mode. It has a slightly smaller version called the [[Large Glasses Toilet]].
== Strategy ==
The '''Giant Glass Toilet''' is a much stronger version of the Large Glasses Toilet, as it is bigger and has more HP. You cannot use any type of TV unit excluding [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]], [[Spider TV]] and [[TV Woman]] to damage this enemy, as it has glasses. You should use high DPS units to defeat this. You can make it even slower with Upgraded Titan Cameraman levels 5/6, TV Woman, or Mech Cameraman, making it much easier to defeat. Do not focus too much on any TV, or on Scientist Cameramen unless your team has enough defense.

== Trivia ==

* It is larger and has more HP than the [[Boss Toilet]].
* It usually appears along either Large Glasses Toilets, Boss Toilets, or Mutant Toilets.
* Giant Glasses Toilet is currently glitched where he slightly floats above the ground, making him look slightly larger.
* It is invincible to some TV units
